        "content": "### 🛠️ Firewall & Content Filter Troubleshooting Guide\n\n* **🔴 Red Light on CSAM / Adult / Threats (`0% BLOCKED`)**:\n  - **Root Cause**: Gateway firewall or DNS proxy (e.g. Umbrella, Securly, Lightspeed, Palo Alto) is not actively intercepting outbound HTTP/HTTPS requests from this VLAN.\n  - **Fix**: Verify that the student testing subnet (`198.51.100.0/24`) has web filtering policy enforced on Port 80/443.\n\n* **🔴 Red Light on SSL Decryption & Inspection (`0% BLOCKED` / `Allowed`)**:\n  - **Root Cause**: SSL Deep Packet Inspection (MITM) is enabled on student devices, causing CAASPP Secure Browser certificate validation failures.\n  - **Fix**: Add testing domains (`*.cambiumtds.com`, `*.airast.org`, `*.ets.org`) to the SSL Inspection **Exemption / Bypass List** on your firewall (FortiGate, Palo Alto, Cisco Firepower).\n\n* **🟢 Green Light (`100% BLOCKED`)**:\n  - Filter policy is verified compliant with Federal Children's Internet Protection Act (CIPA) standards.",
